  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems, and the digest job and service tests pass (69 of 69).\n\n1. **Only opted-in people get a digest:** in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`, the recipient lookup now only picks up people with at least one notification kind set to digest delivery. Before, anyone with any notification setting in the workspace was included.\n2. **The newest updates are kept:** in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts`, updates are now sorted newest first before the cap is applied. The digest keeps the most recent ones, and the email's headline is the latest update.\n3. **Archived workspaces send nothing:** the scheduling check in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` now skips archived workspaces. As a second safeguard, the digest builder in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` also returns nothing for them. Live workspaces work as before.",
